Vendored files
--------------
- app/index.html   (derived from upstream index.html)
- app/hello.conf   (derived from upstream hello.conf)
- app/Dockerfile   (derived from upstream Dockerfile)

Modifications
-------------
- Replaced the Kubernetes Deployment, Service and HPA manifests with the
  HashiCorp Nomad job specification in nomad/nginx.nomad.hcl.
- Added the assessor name, assessment date, build identifier, Git commit and
  build timestamp to index.html, injected at image build time.
- Added /healthz and /build-info.json endpoints, a container HEALTHCHECK and
  image provenance labels to the Dockerfile.
- Updated the base image tag and pinned dependencies.
- Added build, test, deployment, CI and observability automation.

The upstream project had no separate NOTICE file; the Apache-2.0 LICENSE from
the upstream repository is reproduced at the root of this repository.
